# Branch (docs/research/double-battles.md §7.2): Spear Pillar's two battles
# before Cyrus. A constructed start (setup lines, not the story chain; cp15 replays it in order): a Turtwig
# Starter (Barry's TRAINER_RIVAL_SPEAR_PILLAR_TURTWIG team, SpearPillar_SetRivalPartnerTeam), two Pokémon that can
# fight, the Galactic grunts and Mars and Jupiter shown, Barry hidden (the on-transition hides him below state 3).
# 1. The grunts' coord event at 31, 48 (state 0): CheckHasTwoAliveMons is TRUE, so StartTrainerBattle with both
#    grunts and no partner: two trainers against the player alone (decomp Encounter_NewVsTrainer, 19); state 1.
# 2. Mars and Jupiter's coord event on row 32 (state 1): Barry walks in, SpearPillar_SetRivalPartnerTeam picks his
#    full party by the player's starter, StartTagBattle (75) with Mars and Jupiter; each side's replacements come
#    from its own trainer's party. Barry heals the party and leaves; state 2 and the script goes on to Cyrus
#    and the summoning (as in sys-spear-pillar-chain) to state 3. Runs headless in tests/integration/m5-spear-pillar.rom.test.ts.
set var platinum:VAR_PLAYER_STARTER 387
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 100 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_LUCARIO 100 platinum:MOVE_AURA_SPHERE
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_SPEAR_PILLAR_GRUNTS false
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_SPEAR_PILLAR_MARS_JUPITER false
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_SPEAR_PILLAR_CYRUS false
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SPEAR_PILLAR 31 50 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 31 48
+0 release up
advance text 3000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_GALACTIC_GRUNT_SPEAR_PILLAR_1 won trainer-pair
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_GALACTIC_GRUNT_SPEAR_PILLAR_2 won trainer-pair
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SPEAR_PILLAR_STATE 1
# north between the grunts to Mars and Jupiter's row
+0 press up
until position 31 32 3000
+0 release up
advance text 6000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_COMMANDER_MARS_SPEAR_PILLAR won ai-partner
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_COMMANDER_JUPITER_SPEAR_PILLAR won ai-partner
advance text 20000
until yesno 15000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_SPEAR_PILLAR_RIVAL true
+0 press b
+1 release b
advance text 3000
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SPEAR_PILLAR_STATE 3
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SPEAR_PILLAR_DISTORTED_STATE 2
